[DOCTOR]
It doesn't matter, outside-
ມັນບໍ່ສໍາຄັນ, ຢູ່ພາຍນອກ...

763
00:58:05,300 --> 00:58:07,300
[KENDALL]
F-F-F-F-F-F-Fuh-
F-F-F - F - F- F - ຟູ...

764
